=== Backup whole flash ===
  - Connect your JTAG cable from your computer to your board
  - Execute UrJTAG in root mode:\\ <code>sudo jtag</code>
  - Power on the board
  - Immediately execute these commands:\\ <code bash>cable dlc5 ppdev /dev/parport0
detect
endian big
initbus ejtag_dma
detectflash 0x1f800000
readmem 0x1f800000 0x800000 homehub1_backup.bin</code>

=== Restore whole flash ===
  - Connect your JTAG cable from your computer to your board
  - Execute UrJTAG in root mode:\\ <code>sudo jtag</code>
  - Power on the board
  - Immediately execute these commands:\\ <code bash>cable dlc5 ppdev /dev/parport0
detect
endian big
initbus ejtag_dma
detectflash 0x1f800000
flashmem 0x1f800000 homehub1_backup.bin</code>

=== Flashing a bootloader ===
  - Connect your JTAG cable from your computer to your board
  - Execute UrJTAG in root mode:\\ <code>sudo jtag</code>
  - Power on the board
  - Immediately flash the new bootloader:\\ <code bash>cable dlc5 ppdev /dev/parport0
detect
endian big
initbus ejtag_dma
detectflash 0x1f800000
flashmem 0x1fc00000 CFE_homehub1-nvr.bin</code>


